OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to adopt 'zero tolerance'
OL,4,Aabuse policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council is poised to introduce
OL,7,Fa domestic abuse housing policy to help
OL,8,Fsupport victims and safeguard
OL,9,Fvulnerable residents.
OL,11,FTandridge District Council (TDC)
OL,12,Frepresentatives are being asked to
OL,13,Fapprove the plan at a housing committee
OL,14,Fmeeting next week.
OL,16,FWhile council housing services and
OL,17,Fpartner organisations currently help
OL,18,Fsupport victims of domestic abuse, the
OL,19,Fauthority has no overarching strategy
OL,20,Fon the matter, according to the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
