OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to adopt 'zero tolerance'
OL,4,Aabuse policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe policy states that the council
OL,7,Fwould adopt a "zero-tolerance approach"
OL,8,Fto domestic abuse, placing the safety
OL,9,Fof victims and children at the centre
OL,10,Fof all decisions and actions.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
